 without a per-job field; e2e tests; docs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The board's department name is not copied onto each job (it made Amazon's list 3% and NVIDIA's 6% bigger, gzip);
old d= links map through lib/families.js departmentDisplayName. test/e2e/fix-data-3.e2e.js registered.
DATA_SOURCES §7a/§7c/§7e, CONTRACT and methodology-review-beta-2 (MR-28 fixed) updated; comps footnote patch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
